{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you, Leila and Sofia, for putting those specifics on the table now. Leila, I'm noting the 14:00 to 15:00 exact window as a firm scheduling requirement for the combined forum, and I'll make sure that's built into the roundtable discussion and reflected on the calendar. Sofia, I'm noting the two prior commitments — separate confidential-intake channels for each ERG and exactly two sponsor check-ins during the pilot — and I agree those need to be formally recorded in the charter before I approve any temporary operating rules. I will not approve anything until those protections are documented. Let's get the roundtable scheduled now so we can walk through Devin's observations and facilitation recommendations, Grant's HR policy requirements, Leila's scheduling constraint, and Sofia's charter protections all together. I'll send out a scheduling poll immediately after this conversation."}
```

