{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to place something on the formal record now, ahead of the roundtable. I personally observed exactly three recent incidents at the joint Northstar-Mosaic forums in which Mosaic participants were interrupted before they could finish speaking. These observations were not entered into the formal forum record because the chairs have been trying to resolve the tension informally, but I believe they need to be documented before we finalize any combined forum operating rules. Based on these three observed incidents, my concrete recommendation for the temporary operating rules is that the combined forum use a speaking queue enforced by a neutral external facilitator to ensure all participants — especially Mosaic participants — are able to complete their remarks without interruption."}
```

